   "id": 505372,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Perform  the following operation: <span data-math=\"3\\sqrt 7  - 10\\sqrt 7\">3\\sqrt 7  - 10\\sqrt 7</span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"3\\sqrt 7  - 10\\sqrt 7 \"></span></p>\n<p>Because they have the same irrational part, you can subtract without using a calculator.</p>\n<p>The formula uses the distributive property: <span data-math=\"\\left( {a \\times x} \\right) \\pm \\left( {b \\times x} \\right) = \\left( {a \\pm b} \\right) \\times x\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {3 - 10} \\right) \\times \\sqrt 7 \"></span>\tSubtract.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 7\\sqrt 7 \"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"- 7\\sqrt 7\">- 7\\sqrt 7</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
